            <span id="alg2.l5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Forward pass with motion-aware attention to obtain logits </span><math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐩</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
